PART 3 -- GAP-coverability of spread/record families
================================================================================================
  monad record {2..22e}u{11,13}            cover: 21x1 steps (1,1) N=21  mu2(21,1) not in table  ?
  parity diam 80: 8*{0..10}u{39,41}        cover: 11x6 steps (8,3) N=66  mu2(11,6) not in table  ?
